://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">2级效果</span>]，✦战斗回合开始时，强制触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"个性\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">个性</font></span></span>]效果，并获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"破晓之势\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">破晓之势</font></span></span>]。<br />✦触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"个性\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">个性</font></span></span>]效果时，所有职业技能冷却减<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>，额外获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"破晓之势\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">破晓之势</font></span></span>]。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">3级效果</span>]，✦战斗回合开始时，强制触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"个性\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">个性</font></span></span>]效果，并获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">5</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"破晓之势\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">破晓之势</font></span></span>]。<br />✦触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"个性\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">个性</font></span></span>]效果时，所有职业技能冷却减<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>，额外获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"破晓之势\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">破晓之势</font></span></span>]。[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"破晓之势\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">破晓之势</font></span></span>]层数叠满时，转化为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"破晓孤王\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">破晓孤王</font></span></span>]。<br />✦技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">为了伊利亚！</font></span>]中的造成伤害从<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>提高至<font color=\"#ed7950\">30%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\">解放材料\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">\n<p>一级：20<img alt=\"覆雪之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/db/odghvivgd945bs5bdajzn9jeom0r382.png/40px-%E8%A6%86%E9%9B%AA%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/db/odghvivgd945bs5bdajzn9jeom0r382.png/60px-%E8%A6%86%E9%9B%AA%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/db/odghvivgd945bs5bdajzn9jeom0r382.png/80px-%E8%A6%86%E9%9B%AA%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" />，二级：60<img alt=\"覆雪之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/db/odghvivgd94